  "description": "Ha-yeon lost her only younger sibling to an unidentified man.In a hopeless situation where even the police could not find a single clue, Ha-yeon finds herself in danger and is unexpectedly saved by a mysterious man named Yu-seong, who has one blue odd eye.Yu-seong warns Ha-yeon to stop seeking revenge, as if he knows the culprit’s identity. In his cold words, Ha-yeon senses hope that she might be able to catch the criminal, but she is also enraged by his careless attitude. In the end, she follows Yu-seong all the way to his room.And there, she sees countless scars covering Yu-seong’s body.What truth is he hiding—the only hope she has of finding the culprit and taking revenge?“Is it painful when someone dies because of you?If you don’t help me, I’ll die right here in front of you.” +",
